@startuml usecase-external
title Use Case (Actor Cut 3/3) — External legacy systems\n(시스템 경계 밖 · Adapter 로 연동)  ·  red = Iteration 4
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130

rectangle "Korean Air Reservation System" {
  package "Core booking (iter1-2)" {
    usecase "Make Payment" as UC_Pay
    usecase "Search Connecting Flights" as UC_Conn
  }
  package "Iteration 4 additions" #FFF0F0 {
    usecase "Pay with KakaoPay /\nApplePay / Bank transfer" as UC_PayM #FFCCCC
    usecase "Pay with Mileage" as UC_Mile #FFCCCC
  }
}

actor "Payment\nGateway" as Pay <<external>>
actor "Skypass\nSystem" as Skypass <<external>>
actor "GDS\n(flight inventory)" as Gds <<external>>

UC_Pay  --> Pay
UC_PayM --> Pay
UC_Mile .[#CC0000].> Skypass
UC_Conn ..> Gds

note bottom of Pay
  세 외부 액터는 우리가 만들거나
  고칠 수 없는 **legacy 외부 시스템**.
  시스템 경계 밖에 두고
  **DP#8 Adapter** 로 연동한다.
  (Mileage→Skypass 변환이 대표 경계)
end note
@enduml
